<title>UK: SOCCER-F.A. CHARITY SHIELD SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-F.A. CHARITY SHIELD SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of the F.A. Charity Shield</p>
<p>match at Wembley on Sunday:</p>
<p> Chelsea		  1 - Mark Hughes 52</p>
<p> Manchester United    1 - Ronnie Johnsen 57</p>
<p>    HT: 0-0.    Att: 73,636</p>
<p>Manchester United won 4-2 on penalties.</p>
